{"id":"vod_bf_11038","vodId":"11038","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"攻壳机动队AAA","name_cn":"攻壳机动队AAA","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-12/2807c68009eee3cd86f1d9043e277378.jpg"},"summary":"某年的圣诞夜，大批民众聚集到某栋大厦门外，抗议国家与库赞共和国的纯净水合作计划。与此同时，交通网络以及相关电子系统遭到入侵而全面失灵，随后更有维持治安的警察掏枪射击抗议民众。值此危急时刻，公安九课少校的草薙素子（坂本真绫 配音）率领队员巴特（松田健一郎 配音）、陀古萨（新垣樽助 配音）等人迅速展开行动，与恐怖分子和黑客展开连番恶斗。这支个性满满且身怀绝技的机动部队，还要追溯到2027年6月的某天。时任陆军机密部队501机关中佐的真室在街头被人杀害，公安9课课长荒卷大辅（塾一久 配音）在墓地与生化人草薙素子首次邂逅。后者接受荒卷的委托追查真相，在这一过程中和巴特等人邂逅。这正是一段传奇部队“攻壳机动队”成立前夕的故事……　　本片根据士郎正宗的原作改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,科幻,动画,情,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 01:50:59","classic":true,"classicRank":13,"franchise":"攻壳机动队","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduiAAA/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduiAAA/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduiAAA/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduiAAA/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduiAAA/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduiAAA/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduiAAA/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduiAAA/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduiAAA/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduiAAA/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduiAAA/第11集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T15:01:55.586Z"}